{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39394","headline":"上春词 · 韦庄","name":"上春词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曈曨赫日东方来，禁城烟煖蒸青苔。\n金楼美人花屏开，晨妆未罢车声催。\n幽兰报暖紫芽折，夭花愁艳蝶飞回。\n五陵年少惜花落，酒浓歌极翻如哀。\n四时轮环终又始，百年不见南山摧。\n游人陌上骑生尘，颜子门前吹死灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39394.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39394","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}